endence, Pakistan was created in 1947 as an independent homeland for Indian Muslims.[29] It is an ethnically and linguistically diverse country, with a similarly diverse geography and wildlife. Initially a dominion, Pakistan adopted a constitution in 1956, becoming an Islamic republic. An ethnic civil war in 1971 resulted in the secession of East Pakistan as the new country of Bangladesh.[30] In 1973 Pakistan adopted a new constitution establishing, alongside its pre-existing parliamentary republic status, a federal government based in Islamabad consisting of four provinces and three federal territories. The new constitution also stipulated that all laws are to conform to the injunctions of Islam as laid down in the Quran and Sunnah.[31]\\\",\\\"products\\\":{\\\"main\\\":{\\\"1534680048345_594ddfb0\\\":{\\\"sector\\\":\\\"Defence\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"Vehicles - Aircraft Drones (UAV)\\\",\\\"area\\\":\\\"Main Battle Tanks and variants>30 ton\\\"},\\\"1534680053641_dc9b9524\\\":{\\\"sector\\\":\\\"Defence\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"Training & Simulation - Support- Protection- Operational Logistics\\\",\\\"area\\\":\\\"Supporting and Equipping the man\\\"}},\\\"other\\\":{\\\"1534680073928_c8adb9d8\\\":{\\\"sector\\\":\\\"Dummy \\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"Dummy Business\\\",\\\"area\\\":\\\"Dummy Area\\\"}},\\\"product\\\":{\\\"1534680094808_bf1e2273\\\":{\\\"category\\\":\\\"Dummy Product\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"Dummy Type\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dummy Name\\\"}}},\\\"principle\\\":{\\\"is_active\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"principles_list\\\":[{\\\"full_name\\\":\\\"Dummy+2\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"Brazil\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"+51-112-6455454\\\",\\\"fax\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"person_name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"designation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"person_mobile\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"person_email\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"address\\\":\\\"\\\"}]},\\\"exhibit[telephone]\\\":\\\"921234656788\\\",\\\"exhibit[contact_person][mobile]\\\":\\\"920001234567\\\",\\\"exhibit[contact_person][phone]\\\":\\\"92111222333