ion Of A Day Shall Be Charged As One Full Day; Fraction Of An Hour Shall Be Charged As One Full Hour. (3.)Half An Hour Extra Transit Time Shall Be Charged Each Way For Pick Up/Drop Off.\', `description` = \'\', `attachments` = \'\'\nWHERE `id` = \'22\'','103.24.97.62','2018-09-25 09:00:55'),(2467,NULL,'UPDATE `es_exhibition_notification` SET `type` = \'vehicle_rental_terms\', `title` = \'(1.) Rates Are Inclusive Of Chauffeur And Fuel Per Working Day (8 Hours)/per Extra Hour. (2.) Fraction Of A Day Shall Be Charged As One Full Day; Fraction Of An Hour Shall Be Charged As One Full Hour. (3.)Half An Hour Extra Transit Time Shall Be Charged Each Way For Pick Up/Drop Off.\', `description` = \'\', `attachments` = \'\'\nWHERE `id` = \'22\'','103.24.97.62','2018-09-25 09:02:37'),(2468,NULL,'INSERT INTO `es_exhibition_notification` (`exhibition_id`, `type`, `title`, `description`, `attachments`, `created_on`) VALUES (\'13\', \'display_mobility_terms\', \'The Vehicle Mobility Display may take place on 27thNovember, 2018 to 30thNovember 2018 at 13:00 hrs. or other days at the main exhibition site at Karachi Expo Centre if demanded by an Exhibitor. Participation Slot:  Each participating Vehicle/Equipment shall be allocated a 5 minute slot for demonstration. Participation Fee:   Demonstration @ 5 minutes slot shall be charged @ US$ 10,000 each slot.\', \'\', \'\', \'2018-09-25 09:03:58\')','103.24.97.62','2018-09-25 09:03:58'),(2469,NULL,'INSERT INTO `es_exhibition_notification` (`exhibition_id`, `type`, `title`, `description`, `attachments`, `created_on`) VALUES (\'13\', \'hotel_reservation_terms\', \'(1.) Hotel Reservation Confirmation would be e-mailed you within 72 hrs.of receiving this form. (2.) You are required to make full payments to the hotel reception directly at the time of check in/out.  (3.) In case of No Show, One night room charges will be applied.  (4.) Airport Pickup services is complimentary and would be provided as per your given arrival flight schedule. (5.) Airport Drop Shuttle runs every hour. Please contact the hotel reception at least 2 hrs. before you check out.\', \'\', \'\', \'2018-09-25 09:06:39\')','103.24.97.62','2018-09-25 09:06:39'),(2470,NULL,'UPDATE `users` SET `lastLogin` = \'2018-09-25 11:31:17\'\nWHERE `id` = \'1\'','182.176.179.38','2018-09-25 11:31:17'),(2471,26,'UPDATE `es_customers` SET `lastLogin` = \'2018-09-25 11:48:54\'\nWHERE `id` = \'26\'','103.24.97.62','2018-09-25 11:48:54'),(2472,26,'UPDATE `es_customers` SET `lastLogin` = \'2018-09-25 16:46:11\'\nWHERE `id` = \'26\'','182.176.179.38','2018-09-25 16:46:11'),(2473,26,'UPDATE `es_customers` SET `lastLogin` = \'2018-09-26 05:59:36\'\nWHERE `id` = \'26\'','39.57.247.254','2018-09-26 05:59:36'),(2474,NULL,'UPDATE `users` SET `lastLogin` = \'2018-09-26 06:03:55\'\nWHERE `id` = \'1\'','39.57.247.254','2018-09-26 06:03:55'),(2475,26,'UPDATE `es_customers` SET `lastLogin` = \'2018-09-26 09:06:26\'\nWHERE `id` = \'26\'','182.176.179.38','2018-09-26 09:06:26'),(2476,26,'UPDATE `es_exhibition_booking_forms_data` SET `form_data` = \'{\\\"vehicle\\\":[{\\\"company\\\":\\\"Test Company\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Karachi\\\",\\\"contact_person\\\":\\\"iqra laiq\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"000111000111\\\",\\\"mobile\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"test\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"2\\\",\\\"quantity\\\":\\\"2\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"2000\\\",\\\"venue\\\":\\\"Karachi Expo Center\\\",\\\"event_day\\\":\\\"2\\\",\\\"img_index\\\":[\\\"0\\\"],\\\"vehicle_image\\\":[\\\"..\\\\/uploads\\\\/form_23\\\\/15373002506505ba1571ae14f2.jpg\\\"],\\\"img_rotate\\\":[\\\"0\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"15373002577265ba15721211f6\\\"},{\\\"company\\\":\\\"Test Company\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Karachi\\\",\\\"contact_person\\\":\\\"iqra laiq\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"000111000111\\\",\\\"mobile\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"teset\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"2\\\",\\\"quantity\\\":\\\"2\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"10000\\\",\\\"venue\\\":\\\"Ka